    "name": "Boogie Fungi",
    "steam_appid": 3708060,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and maintain a colony of Mushrooms, keep them happy with constant parties and make sure to deploy some defenses to deal with foragers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708060/extras/a0f7e0c46a6d1f2285882536e3859cb6.poster.avif?t=1755522032\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708060/extras/a0f7e0c46a6d1f2285882536e3859cb6.webm?t=1755522032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708060/extras/a0f7e0c46a6d1f2285882536e3859cb6.mp4?t=1755522032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and place a different array of substrates in your colony, each with different properties that affect the live of the mycelium, the Frozard is your guy! he not only offers the selection of substrates but also an array of fro-products so be sure to check his store out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708060/extras/7636aa63eea62ebff622c1c01d0a42e5.poster.avif?t=1755522032\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708060/extras/7636aa63eea62ebff622c1c01d0a42e5.webm?t=1755522032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708060/extras/7636aa63eea62ebff622c1c01d0a42e5.mp4?t=1755522032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept requests from different mushroom that want to join your colony, each with different substrate required so, select where they should establish some roots! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708060/extras/09da97a0cde2087636f30da5a281d1d7.poster.avif?t=1755522032\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708060/extras/09da97a0cde2087636f30da5a281d1d7.webm?t=1755522032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708060/extras/09da97a0cde2087636f30da5a281d1d7.mp4?t=1755522032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of your Mushroom by keeping them happy with parties and level them up by giving them some tasty nutrients!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708060/extras/7fcc8cf1cce7fe21f9e78deaca4aa67f.poster.avif?t=1755522032\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708060/extras/7fcc8cf1cce7fe21f9e78deaca4aa67f.webm?t=1755522032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708060/extras/7fcc8cf1cce7fe21f9e78deaca4aa67f.mp4?t=1755522032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These pesky guys mean trouble, they will simply pluck your Mushroom from their homes! But that is ok, the mycelium lives on, for a time. In any case, make sure to hire some muscle and add some defensive upgrades!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and maintain a colony of Mushrooms, keep them happy with constant parties and make sure to deploy some defenses to deal with foragers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708060/extras/a0f7e0c46a6d1f2285882536e3859cb6.poster.avif?t=1755522032\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708060/extras/a0f7e0c46a6d1f2285882536e3859cb6.webm?t=1755522032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708060/extras/a0f7e0c46a6d1f2285882536e3859cb6.mp4?t=1755522032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and place a different array of substrates in your colony, each with different properties that affect the live of the mycelium, the Frozard is your guy! he not only offers the selection of substrates but also an array of fro-products so be sure to check his store out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708060/extras/7636aa63eea62ebff622c1c01d0a42e5.poster.avif?t=1755522032\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708060/extras/7636aa63eea62ebff622c1c01d0a42e5.webm?t=1755522032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708060/extras/7636aa63eea62ebff622c1c01d0a42e5.mp4?t=1755522032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept requests from different mushroom that want to join your colony, each with different substrate required so, select where they should establish some roots! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708060/extras/09da97a0cde2087636f30da5a281d1d7.poster.avif?t=1755522032\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708060/extras/09da97a0cde2087636f30da5a281d1d7.webm?t=1755522032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708060/extras/09da97a0cde2087636f30da5a281d1d7.mp4?t=1755522032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of your Mushroom by keeping them happy with parties and level them up by giving them some tasty nutrients!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708060/extras/7fcc8cf1cce7fe21f9e78deaca4aa67f.poster.avif?t=1755522032\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708060/extras/7fcc8cf1cce7fe21f9e78deaca4aa67f.webm?t=1755522032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708060/extras/7fcc8cf1cce7fe21f9e78deaca4aa67f.mp4?t=1755522032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These pesky guys mean trouble, they will simply pluck your Mushroom from their homes! But that is ok, the mycelium lives on, for a time. In any case, make sure to hire some muscle and add some defensive upgrades!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
